subproblem.statement:
Let P, m ∈ ℕ, let l_0, …, l_m be continuous linear functionals on ℝ^P (l : Fin (m+1) → (ℝ^P)^*), and let j ∈ Fin (m+1). Write l∘j.succAbove for the m-tuple k ↦ l_{j.succAbove k}, i.e. the family l with l_j omitted. Then:
(a) wedgeCovectors (m+1) (Fin.cons l_j (l∘j.succAbove)) = (−1)^j • wedgeCovectors (m+1) l, where j is read as a natural number in {0, …, m};
(b) wedgeCovectors (m+1) (Fin.cons l_i (l∘j.succAbove)) = 0 for every i ∈ Fin (m+1) with i ≠ j.
